## 💡 Business Recommendations

- **Prioritize escalation resolution** — given the 0.77 correlation with churn, faster/better first-contact resolution on escalated support tickets is likely the highest-leverage retention lever
- **Target the Basic plan segment** with save-offers or upsell paths to Standard/Premium, where churn drops significantly
- **Weigh a proactive retention program** against the $73.94K in monthly revenue currently sitting with churned accounts

